  "nextDecision": "Kevin needs to name the people who own ordinary support, safeguarding, privacy, accessibility, and legal or payment questions before live messages can be connected. The safeguarding route needs a primary person, a backup, an urgent way to reach them, the places and hours covered, and a tested fallback. A private case system needs agreed access, retention, deletion, and incident rules. The exact inbox and reply process must then be reviewed with invented messages before any real message is read. A separate approval is required to connect the inbox, and another separate approval is required before any reply is sent. Mythical must never contact a child automatically, reuse support contact details for marketing, store raw messages in the shared project, or allow the assistant to approve its own reply. Until those steps are complete, A-056 remains an offline rehearsal only."
